OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for AI data centre approved
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an AI data centre in Kent
OL,7,Fhave been approved by Canterbury City
OL,8,FCouncil.
OL,10,FEra4, a British technology
OL,11,Finfrastructure company, sought planning
OL,12,Fpermission for the site near the
OL,13,FShelford Landfill in Broad Oak,
OL,14,FCanterbury.
OL,16,FThe company said the brownfield site,
OL,17,Fpreviously used as a composting
OL,18,Ffacility and now for general storage,
OL,19,Fprovided an "opportunity to make
OL,20,Fefficient use of land and to connect to
OL,21,Fan on-site source of renewable energy".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
