OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for AI data centre approved
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite concerns around the plans'
OL,7,Fwater cooling system and water usage,
OL,8,Fthe council's planning committee
OL,9,Fapproved it with four votes in favour,
OL,10,Fthree abstentions and one against,
OL,11,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,12,FReporting Service (LDRS).
